msgid "顶层共享 MCU `drivers/` 已归入 F4，不增加运行时转发。ILI9341、XPT2046、W25 继续通过公共 I/O 访问设备，留在组件目录，不随 MCU 支持包迁移。"
msgstr "Shared MCU sources formerly under root `drivers/` now belong to F4, without extra runtime forwarding. ILI9341, XPT2046 and W25 continue to use public I/O and remain in components rather than moving with the MCU support package."

msgid "Board 和 SoC 不加载本地 Python 插件。声明式包由通用 DataProvider 读取同一快照的 事实和显式 binding 文件，DomainPolicies 决定已维护公共语义与私有投影，有限静态 节点生成配置、存储、face、IRQ 与固定生命周期连接。CMake 仍拥有唯一 C 源码图， SDK 只按选择的包导出归属收集源码。结构图见 [FIG-03 构建期输入与产物](../assets/diagrams/configuration-generation.svg)， 详细字段与迁移边界由[接入指南](../guides/provider-porting.md)唯一维护。"
msgstr "Board and SoC load no local Python plugins. Generic DataProvider reads one snapshot of declarative package facts and explicit binding files. DomainPolicies determines maintained public semantics and private projections; bounded static nodes emit configuration, storage, faces, IRQ and fixed lifecycle connections. CMake still owns the sole C source graph. The SDK collects source only by selected package export ownership. See [FIG-03 build-time inputs and artifacts](../assets/diagrams/configuration-generation.svg); the [porting guide](../guides/provider-porting.md) uniquely owns detailed fields and migration boundaries."

msgid "生产默认路径已采用通用 DataProvider，旧 F4 家族 Python 构造模块和导入注册表已 删除。包事实、策略、各模式和消费者仍须本批集成验证；不能从删除旧代码推定整体 资格。主机 Python 不进入固件，硬件算法和执行顺序由 C 维护。"
msgstr "The production default now uses generic DataProvider; old F4 family Python constructor modules and their import registry have been removed. Package facts, policies, individual modes and consumers still require this batch's integrated validation. Removing old code does not establish overall qualification. Host Python is not linked into firmware; C owns hardware algorithms and execution ordering."

msgid "Core `private/platform_lifecycle_impl.h` 维护整平台启动、停止、回滚与诊断，F4 `system/stm32f4_platform_lifecycle_impl.h` 维护 System 与共享资源的 C 协调；各自的 `.c` 公共入口复用同一实现，固定装配让编译器看到常量并裁剪分支。主机只维护 一套配置实现，其代码不进入 MCU 镜像。实际生成 factory、模型与 ARM 产物 各自验证，不能把源码移动视为整条链路已经验收。 Native 必须显式启用测试 scope，不进入生产系列目录或能力聚合表。"
msgstr "Core `private/platform_lifecycle_impl.h` owns whole-platform start, stop, rollback and diagnostics. F4 `system/stm32f4_platform_lifecycle_impl.h` owns C coordination of System and shared resources. Their public `.c` entries reuse the same implementation; fixed assembly exposes constants for compiler branch elimination. One host configuration implementation is maintained and is not linked into the MCU image. Generated factories, models and ARM artifacts are verified separately; source movement does not qualify the entire chain. Native requires explicit test scope and stays outside production family directories and capability aggregation."

msgid "精确支持见[支持参考](../reference/platforms/support.md)。重构前的目录与执行范围可从 [固定旧源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18) 追溯；旧记录保留原始身份，不建立本次重构的软件候选或实板资格。"
msgstr "See the [support reference](../reference/platforms/support.md) for exact support. Pre-refactor directories and execution scopes remain traceable at the [fixed prior source](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18). Old records retain their original identities and do not establish software candidates or physical-board qualification for this refactor."

msgid "目录维护规则"
msgstr "Directory maintenance rules"

msgid "公共头位于所属模块的 `include/nexus/`，实现与内部合同分别放在 `src/` 和 `private/`；只在实际规模需要时增加子目录，不要求每个叶子拥有相同空层级。 新组件加入既有五类之一并显式登记 CMake；新增同类器件优先维护精确事实和复用 C。 新增公共语义仍需同时审查接口、配置和验证，不假设任意硬件都能只填数据。"
msgstr "Public headers belong in their module's `include/nexus/`; implementations and internal contracts belong in `src/` and `private/`. Add subdirectories only when their real scale requires them; each leaf need not have identical empty layers. Add a component to one of the five existing categories and register it explicitly in CMake. New similar devices should first reuse C implementation and maintain exact facts. New public semantics still require interface, configuration and validation review; arbitrary hardware cannot always be integrated by filling in data alone."

msgid "`tools/` 维护可复用的主机能力，`scripts/` 提供安装和工程门禁入口，`.github/` 编排相同工具，`.vscode/` 只引用受维护 preset。测试按被测领域组织，源码合同、 独立 SDK 消费和物理观测各保留自己的准入；删除夹具须说明合同退役或独立替代证据。"
msgstr "`tools/` maintains reusable host capabilities, `scripts/` provides setup and engineering gates, `.github/` orchestrates the same tools, and `.vscode/` references only maintained presets. Organize tests by the domain under test. Source contracts, independent SDK consumption and physical observations retain separate admission. Removing a fixture requires an obsolete contract or independent replacement evidence."

msgid "`dependencies/` 记录锁定身份和审核，`ext/` 保存通用依赖，`vendors/` 保存官方 硬件依赖与未启用库存。供应方原目录和许可证不按 Nexus 风格重排。`.git/`、 `.venv/` 与 `build/` 是本地状态；清理构建产物前保留仍需追溯的唯一原始记录。"
msgstr "`dependencies/` records locked identities and reviews, `ext/` holds general dependencies, and `vendors/` holds official hardware dependencies and unselected inventory. Do not reorganize supplier source directories or licenses to match Nexus style. `.git/`, `.venv/` and `build/` are local state. Before cleaning build products, preserve unique original records that remain necessary for traceability."
